(6811172, 1024120, 124815, '<td valign="top">So painterly but still a photo. Well done.</td>', 'So painterly but still a photo. Well done.', '2012-07-06 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6811213, 1024209, 108982, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like blur photos and as a rule don''t do these challenges but I like to see what others come up with.  Rarely does this type of work speak to me but this capture is simply fantastic.  I can still identify the root of the photo and the colors, whether manipulated or natural are so well worked together that the entire photo is very captivating.  Despite person disdain for these types, yours is an absolute winner 10</td>', 'I usually don''t like blur photos and as a rule don''t do these challenges but I like to see what others come up with.  Rarely does this type of work speak to me but this capture is simply fantastic.  I can still identify the root of the photo and the colors, whether manipulated or natural are so well worked together that the entire photo is very captivating.  Despite person disdain for these types, yours is an absolute winner 10', '2012-07-06 22:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6811218, 1024154, 108982, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like blur photos and as a rule don''t do these challenges but I like to see what others come up with.  Initially I had this as an 8 but after further review it kept grabbing my attention.  My mind pictures a beautiful girl at a train station or a park bench and there is just enough distortion to never give me a solid truth.  very nice, now it''s a 10 :o)</td>', 'I usually don''t like blur photos and as a rule don''t do these challenges but I like to see what others come up with.  Initially I had this as an 8 but after further review it kept grabbing my attention.  My mind pictures a beautiful girl at a train station or a park bench and there is just enough distortion to never give me a solid truth.  very nice, now it''s a 10 :o)', '2012-07-06 22:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6811219, 1023990, 108982, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like blur photos and as a rule don''t do these challenges but I like to see what others come up with.  Yours has a certain character and Identifiable theme and I dig the subtle use of angle and the perception of energy or momentum.  nicely done 10</td>', 'I usually don''t like blur photos and as a rule don''t do these challenges but I like to see what others come up with.  Yours has a certain character and Identifiable theme and I dig the subtle use of angle and the perception of energy or momentum.  nicely done 10', '2012-07-06 22:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
