(6821190, 1023855, 23412, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture!  It looks like an oil painting.  I love the wispiness of the flowers and the way they move off to the right across a power point in the frame.  To my eye there are just a few detractors here.  The last full flower along the top right has an unfortunate stem that could be cloned out along the left side of the petals.  There is a similar hard looking stem on the left that runs left to right and is counter to the pattern of the others.  The highlights are blown out on the last full flower in the top right.  I would maybe have tried to mute that somehow in post.  The partial flower in the corner has the same issue, but it is not important to the photo, so I might have just cropped that one out.  Great colors and composition.  Good eye for spotting this as a photo opportunity and making something ordinary into something extraordinary.</td>', 'I really like this picture!  It looks like an oil painting.  I love the wispiness of the flowers and the way they move off to the right across a power point in the frame.  To my eye there are just a few detractors here.  The last full flower along the top right has an unfortunate stem that could be cloned out along the left side of the petals.  There is a similar hard looking stem on the left that runs left to right and is counter to the pattern of the others.  The highlights are blown out on the last full flower in the top right.  I would maybe have tried to mute that somehow in post.  The partial flower in the corner has the same issue, but it is not important to the photo, so I might have just cropped that one out.  Great colors and composition.  Good eye for spotting this as a photo opportunity and making something ordinary into something extraordinary.', '2012-07-19 10:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
